{"ref":"BDB, שְׁפַטְיָה(וּ)","hw":"שְׁפַטְיָה(וּ)","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפַטְיָה(וּ)</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>hath judged, vindicated</em><strong>)</strong>;—usually Σαφατια(ς):<br><strong>1.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  fifth son of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.4\">2 S 3:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.3\">1 Ch 3:3</a> (Σαβατεια, A Σαφαθια, 𝔊L Σαφατιας). <strong>b.</strong>  contemp. of Jerem. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.1\">Je 38:1</a> (B Σαφανιας) <strong>c.</strong>  man of Judah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.4\">Ne 11:4</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  chiefs of families of restoration: (1) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:4\" href=\"/Ezra.2.4\">Ezr 2:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.9\">Ne 7:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:8\" href=\"/Ezra.8.8\">Ezr 8:8</a>; (2) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:57\" href=\"/Ezra.2.57\">2:57</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:58\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.58\">Ne 7:59</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.8\">1 Ch 9:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  son of Jehosh. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.2\">2 Ch 21:2</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  hero of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.5\">1 Ch 12:5</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  Simeonite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.16\">27:16</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁפְטָן","prev":"BDB, מִשְׁפָּט²"}